magic
tech OR1
<< metal1 >>
rect 0 56 19 60
rect 0 -1 19 3
<< metal2 >>
rect 14 17 18 21
rect 2 29 6 33
rect 8 23 12 27
<< labels >>
rlabel metal1 s 0 56 19 60 6 VDD
port 1 nsew power input
rlabel metal1 s 0 -1 19 3 6 VSS
port 2 nsew ground input
rlabel metal2 s 2 29 6 33 6 A
port 3 nsew signal input
rlabel metal2 s 8 23 12 27 6 B
port 4 nsew signal input
rlabel metal2 s 14 17 18 21 6 Y
port 5 nsew signal output
<< properties >>
string FIXED_BBOX 0 0 19 60
string LEFclass CORE
string LEFsite unit
string LEFsymmetry X Y
string LEFview TRUE
<< end >>
